# DESK35 -- a GEM application started with desktop windows open.
#
#   C_TWO_WINDOWS  two windows on C:\, window 2 on top
#   D_APP_RUNNING  GEMWIN.NAP's own window, and what else is on the screen
#   E_DESKTOP_BACK the desktop after the program terminated by itself
#
# Coordinates from the d-probe2 dump on THIS card image:
#   C: drive icon                 click (37,42)
#   'GEMWIN.NAP' in window 2      box (165,195) 76x40 -> click (203,211)
#
# GEMWIN.NAP holds its window for 6 s (1200 ticks) and then returns, so
# D_APP_RUNNING is taken ~3 s into that and E_DESKTOP_BACK well after it.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 37 42
1700 down
1703 up
1710 down
1713 up
2300 move 600 240
2900 mark B_WIN1
3200 move 37 42
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4000 move 600 240
4600 mark C_TWO_WINDOWS
5000 move 203 211
5200 down
5203 up
5210 down
5213 up
5900 mark D_APP_RUNNING
7800 mark E_DESKTOP_BACK
